error[RB0318]: `map<string, Login>` has sensitive fields, and argument `v` of `show` is `json`
  --> RB0318-sensitive-generic-into-json.road:14:19
   |
14 |     entry do show(logins), show(page), shown(page), keys(logins), fine(page, logins)
   |                   ^^^^^^ a trace would show these fields
